OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AEnergy bills to rise by 26% from
OL,4,AJanuary
OL,5,
OL,6,FOfgem said that, for a typical
OL,7,Fhousehold in England, Scotland and
OL,8,FWales paying by direct debit for gas
OL,9,Fand electricity, the increase would
OL,10,Fmean an annual bill would rise from
OL,11,F#1,723 to #2,166 if this level was
OL,12,Fsustained for a year.
OL,14,FThe government will make a #100 payment
OL,15,Fto millions of households from 4
OL,16,FJanuary to help cover winter costs, in
OL,17,Faddition to an ongoing VAT cut on
OL,18,Felectricity.
OL,23,APub: 25-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG4/39
