OL,3,AHuawei found guilty of stealing US
OL,4,Atrade secrets but acquitted of
OL,5,Aracketeering
OL,6,
OL,7,FHuawei has been found guilty of
OL,8,Fconspiracy to steal trade secrets and
OL,9,Fbank fraud, but not guilty of the more
OL,10,Fserious overarching racketeering charge
OL,11,Fin a landmark case in the US.
OL,13,FIn a two-month trial, prosecutors
OL,14,Faccused the Chinese technology and
OL,15,Ftelecommunications giant of lying,
OL,16,Fcheating and stealing to gain any
OL,17,Fcompetitive advantage.
OL,23,APub: 24-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG13/39
